  "translation": "Last weekend, I went grocery shopping with my family. We first set out from home. We parked the car in front of the supermarket. There were many people inside the supermarket, very lively. We pushed a shopping cart and turned left to go to the fruit section. On the left were apples, on the right were oranges, and we bought those apples and these oranges. Mom is very good at selecting fruits; she picked the best. Then we also went to the vegetable section and bought greens and carrots. Next, we went to the meat section and bought three pieces of beef and two pieces of chicken. Mom asked me what I wanted to drink, and I chose cola and juice. Mom didn't object, so we then bought those drinks. Finally, we went to the cashier to pay, spending over 300 yuan in total. On the way home, I felt very tired but very happy."
